            "text": "(In reply to Benjamin Tyner from comment #1)\n> Created attachment 2412 [details]\n> patch for stats::convolve\n\nDidn't have time yet to look... but I have had my own patch for years... which instead of changing the behavior of one type also introduces new 'type's  allowing some back compatibility...\n\nBen, maybe we can look at both... or I also post my patch (several files, notably also documentation) here...",
